\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Certificate mismatch from local stop evidence. A workflow may observe no-new findings, agreement, or a stable summary under evidence condition \(U\). Promoting that stop proposal to a completion claim over \(\Omega \) is unsafe when \(U\neq  \Omega \); the unobserved source-route strata are not certified.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
